ce": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": "24 hours"}, {"n": 21, "text": "If an item is sold at marked price, the percentage of profit is 50%. A discount of x% is offered on the marked price and the profit earned is x%. The value of x is ______.", "options": [{"text": "25", "added": false}, {"text": "22.5", "added": false}, {"text": "27.5", "added": false}, {"text": "20", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": "20"}, {"n": 22, "text": "Evaluate the value of x if (5420 + 3312 + x) ÷ 600 = 25.93.", "options": [{"text": "6359", "added": false}, {"text": "6826", "added": false}, {"text": "6287", "added": false}, {"text": "1558", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": "6826"}, {"n": 23, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "8,235 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "3,258 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "5,832 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "2,538 cm3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cube-cuboid", "key_answer": "5,832 cm³"}, {"n": 24, "text": "At what rate of compound interest per annum will a sum of ₹3,600 become ₹4,277.16 in 2 years?", "options": [{"text": "9%", "added": false}, {"text": "8%", "added": false}, {"text": "9.5%", "added": false}, {"text": "8.5%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Compound Interest", "sub": "ci-formula", "key_answer": "9%"}, {"n": 25, "text": "PQRS is a rectangle. The ratio of the sides PQ and QR is 3 : 4. If the length of the diagonal PR is 10 cm, then what is the perimeter (in cm) of the rectangle?", "options": [{"text": "24", "added": false}, {"text": "28", "added": false}, {"text": "36", "added": false}, {"text": "30", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "ratio-basics", "key_answer": "28"}, {"n": 26, "text": "A student’s marks in an exam increased from 72 to 90. What is the percentage increase in the student's marks?", "options": [{"text": "20%", "added": false}, {"text": "10%", "added": false}, {"text": "25%", "added": false}, {"text": "15%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "increase-decrease", "key_answer": "25%"}, {"n": 27, "text": "In an exam, the average marks obtained by John in English, Maths, Hindi and Drawing were 50.5. His average marks in Maths, Science, Social Studies and Craft were 70. If the average marks in all seven subjects was 58, his score in Maths was:", "options": [{"text": "50", "added": false}, {"text": "60", "added": false}, {"text": "76", "added": false}, {"text": "52", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Average", "sub": "simple-average", "key_answer": "76"}, {"n": 28, "text": "A car travels 194 km in the first hour and 286 km in the second hour. What is the average speed (in km/h) of the car for the whole journey?", "options": [{"text": "246", "added": false}, {"text": "249", "added": false}, {"text": "240", "added": false}, {"text": "234", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": "240"}, {"n": 29, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "8%", "added": false}, {"text": "4%", "added": false}, {"text": "6%", "added": false}, {"text": "2%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": "4%"}, {"n": 30, "text": "Which of the following numbers is exactly divisible by all prime numbers between 1 and 17?", "options": [{"text": "550540", "added": false}, {"text": "818313", "added": false}, {"text": "459545", "added": false}, {"text": "150150", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Number System", "sub